    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "redefine myself? how. there's no \"other version\" of me. everything i ever did was for this. it's not just a bad job or a setback, it's like the foundation of my entire existence just crumbled. i look in the mirror and there's nothing there. just a shell of someone who failed. it feels like the person i was is already dead.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
